&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;【不動産事業原価明細書】&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 648px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
